<title>FINLAND: FISKARS 1996 PROFIT RISES NINE PCT.</title>
<headline>FISKARS 1996 PROFIT RISES NINE PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to December 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			   215 vs 198</p>
<p> Net sales					  2,100 vs 2,320</p>
<p> Operating profit				   220 vs 239</p>
<p> Net extraordinary items			  480 vs 29</p>
<p> Net profit					   615 vs 147</p>
<p> Proposed dividend A share		     7.50 vs 7.50</p>
<p> Proposed dividend K share		     6.70 vs 6.70</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish consumer goods company is</p>
<p>Fiskars Oy Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0240</p>
